<title>JAPAN: Sega shares suspended from trade on Tokyo bourse.</title>
<headline>Sega shares suspended from trade on Tokyo bourse.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sega Enterprises Ltd shares were suspended from trade in Tokyo on Friday, the Tokyo Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The reason for the suspension was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
